<title>BAHRAIN: Saudi Ceramics Co 1996 net profit drops sharply.</title>
<headline>Saudi Ceramics Co 1996 net profit drops sharply.</headline>
<dateline>MANAMA 1997-03-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>			   (million Saudi riyals)</p>
<p> Net profit		 10.3  vs   37.9</p>
<p> Sales income	    154.8  vs  180.3</p>
<p> Sales cost		107.9  vs  103.3</p>
<p> Other income		1.4  vs    2.6</p>
<p> Dividend		    nil  vs   30.0</p>
<p>Shareholders' equity  334.5  vs  324.2</p>
<p>Full Name: The Saudi Ceramics Company.</p>
<p>Note - The firm plans to increase its paid-in capital by 50 million riyals to 200 million riyals by issuing bonus shares to shareholders on a one-for-three basis paid for from accumulated profits.</p>
</text>
